<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: REUTER-HARVEST CONSENSUS ESTIMATES UP TO OCT 25.</title>
<headline>REUTER-HARVEST CONSENSUS ESTIMATES UP TO OCT 25.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are key exchange, interest rate and macro-economic estimates for 1996 prepared by Harvest Financial services and distributed to subscribers of Reuters Irish News Service.</p>
<p>Harvest said the estimates were compiled from Ireland's &quot;top ten banking and stockbroking institutions&quot;.</p>
<p>The estimates will be updated every fortnight.</p>
<p>			     Forecasts		Current</p>
<p>			Mean    High    Low	    Actual</p>
<p>EXCHANGE RATES:</p>
<p>Irish/sterling</p>
<p>Q4 1996	    1.020    1.03    1.01	 1.008</p>
<p>Q1 1997	    1.028    1.05    1.01</p>
<p>Irish/mark</p>
<p>Q4 1996	    2.457    2.50    2.43	 2.459</p>
<p>Q1 1997	    2.434    2.48    2.40</p>
<p>Irish/dollar</p>
<p>Q4 1996	    1.606    1.63    1.57	 1.618</p>
<p>Q1 1997	    1.599    1.64    1.56</p>
<p>INTEREST RATES:</p>
